	{"@id":"gpc:50350000","type":"gpc:Family","label_en":"Leaf Vegetables - Unprepared/Unprocessed (Fresh)","subClassOf":"gpc:50000000","comment_en":"This standard applies to fresh plant leaves eaten as a vegetable. They are also called greens, vegetable greens, leafy greens or salad greens and potherbs. They may include tender petioles, the stalk that joins a leaf to a stem, and shoots which share nutrition and cooking methods with other leaf vegetables."},
