	{"@id":"gpc:10007391","type":"gpc:Brick","label_en":"Sesbanplants (Sesbania Spp.)","subClassOf":"gpc:94030300","comment_en":"Includes any product that can be described/observed as the cultivated unharvested form of Sesbanplants, grown from various species and varieties (cultivars) in the genus Sesbania spp. to be used as a forage, as feed for livestock, as green manure or as a covercrop. Specifically excludes harvested products from Sesbanplants and by-products such as Prepared/Processed or Unprepared/Unprocessed Sesban. EPPO Code: 1SEBG"},
