	{"@id":"gpc:20000970","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"Type of Specialist Activity","comment_en":"Indicates, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify the sport or activity for which the specialist athletic footwear is produced."},
