	{"@id":"gpc:20001579","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"If With Knife Sharpener","comment_en":"Indicates with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the manufacturer to identify whether the product comes with the means to sharpen a knife."},
