	{"@id":"gpc:20001727","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"If Rocking","comment_en":"Indicates, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify whether the chair is designed in such a way that it can be rocked or moved to and fro by the sitter."},
