	{"@id":"gpc:20002524","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"Type of Connector","comment_en":"Indicates, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify the type of connector."},
