	{"@id":"gpc:20002312","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"Audio/Visual","comment_en":"Indicates, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify whether the product records sound or graphics or both."},
