	{"@id":"gpc:20002296","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"Construction Technique","comment_en":"Indicate, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify the manufacturing process used to produce the product."},
