	{"@id":"gpc:20002480","type":["gpc:Attribute","rdf:Property"],"label_en":"If Bulletproof","comment_en":"Indicate, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify whether the glass has been reinforced to be impenetrable by bullets."},
