	{"@id":"gpc:30010957","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"SUBMERGED"},
	{"@id":"gpc:30008745","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"BOWLS","comment_en":"Bowls is one of a wide range of games in which the objective is to throw or roll heavy balls as close as possible to a small target ball. Other terms used for these games are &quot;Bocce/Boccia&quot; in Italy and &quot;Boules&quot; or &quot;P&#233;tanque&quot; in France."},
	{"@id":"gpc:30013552","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"MEMO CLIP"},
	{"@id":"gpc:30006878","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"MORE THAN ONE MONTH"},
	{"@id":"gpc:30012967","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"AUSTRIA - UPPER AUSTRIA"},
	{"@id":"gpc:30018117","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"BAYONET CLOSURE","comment_en":"This term is used to describe a type of closure of pressure cooker. To close the lid, it is necessary to put the lid on the tank, then to turn the lid until the arrows drawn on the lid are aligned with arrows drawn on the tank."},
