	{"@id":"gpc:30002098","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"SALAMI","comment_en":"Salami is a cured sausage, fermented and air-dried, which can be stored at room temperature for periods of up to a year. Well known are Italian Salami, Hungarian Szal&#225;mi and Spanish Salchich&#243;n. Salami is cured in warm, humid conditions in order to encourage growth of the bacteria involved in the fermentation process. After fermentation,the sausage has to be dried."},
	{"@id":"gpc:30010441","type":"gpc:AttributeValue","label_en":"CHEMISE"},
